{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/passo-bella-beyond-palm-jumeirah","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":1413,"crm_id":"7309","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":null,"title":"Passo Bella","slug":"passo-bella-beyond-palm-jumeirah","display_address":"Palm Jumeirah","building_type":["apartment"],"completion_year":"2029","developer":"Beyond","price":6200000,"display_price":"6.2M","lattitude":25.114980825088,"longitude":55.109826819256,"min_bedrooms":2,"max_bedrooms":6,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Bella by PASSO offers an unparalleled opportunity for luxury living on <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/area-guides/palm-jumeirah/\">Palm Jumeirah</a>. This project redefines beachfront living with its unique architectural style and world-class amenities. With fluid facades and panoramic sea views, each residence offers elevated living spaces that harmonize seamlessly with nature. This exclusive development comprises a variety of unit types, including<strong> 2 to 6-bedroom residences, penthouses, and beach mansions.</strong></p><p>Bella PASSO residences in Palm Jumeirah are designed to cater to every lifestyle. Every home is crafted to embrace the serene beauty of its surroundings while boasting state-of-the-art amenities such as experiences pool, wellness pavilion, and more. The project is an ideal investment, not just for its design, but also for the promise of exceptional capital appreciation and long-term returns.</p>","tile_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Feature_6c8339d3cc.jpg","hash":"Feature_6c8339d3cc","name":"Feature.jpg"},"banner_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Banner_4b37fb52ca.jpg","hash":"Banner_4b37fb52ca","name":"Banner.jpg"},"media_images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s