tuated on Palm Jumeirah’s West Crescent, Bella PASSO by <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/new-projects/developed-by-beyond/\">Beyond </a>offers direct beachfront access and breathtaking views of the Arabian Gulf, Dubai Marina, and the iconic Burj Khalifa.</li><li>Developer Reputation: Developed by BEYOND, a renowned name in luxury real estate, known for its attention to detail and innovative designs.</li><li>Exclusive Residences: A limited collection of 268 residences, 3 penthouses, and 3 beach mansions, offering a variety of options to cater to different investor profiles.</li><li>Multiple Unit Sizes: Homes in PASSO Bella Tower by Beyond Development range from 2-bedroom apartments (1,541 sqft) to expansive 6-bedroom beach mansions (12,382 sqft), providing ample space for both family living and elite investment opportunities.</li><li>Luxury Amenities: PASSO Bella Tower amenities offer a comprehensive suite of resort-level amenities such as private beach access, a wellness pavilion, infinity pools, and a spa.</li><li>Architectural Masterpiece: Bella by PASSO masterplan is designed with sculptural fluidity, creating a seamless blend of nature and cutting-edge design that stands out as a landmark on Palm Jumeirah.</li><li>Strong Rental Potential: Due to its location and luxury offerings, the project is well-positioned to yield strong rental returns, particularly from high-net-worth individuals seeking a prestigious address.</li><li>Strategic Connectivity: Close proximity to Dubai’s major landmarks, including Atlantis The Royal (4 minutes), Nakheel Mall (10 minutes), Dubai Marina (15 minutes), and Dubai International Airport (35 minutes), makes it a convenient choice for residents and investors alike.</li></ul>","design_title":null},"location_tile":{"id":2068,"cta":{"id":2906,"icon":null,"menu":null,"cta_label":"Get more information","isExternal":false,"custom_link":"#payment-plans"},"image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providen